If you are researching Algility, this is a starting point for finding the company’s official channels, reviewing its work, and getting in touch. I’m Christian Garcia, Algility’s founder. I put this guide together so you can find the right company profiles without sorting through similarly named businesses.

## What is Algility?

[Algility](https://www.algility.com/) builds AI systems and custom software for organizations that need their tools to fit existing workflows, data access requirements, and human review. Its current focus is AI for high-stakes industries, alongside systems for sales, growth, and operations.

The work includes internal applications, system integrations, document intake, research tools, and task-specific AI workflows. A useful first conversation starts with the work your team needs to complete, the systems it already uses, and the decisions people need to keep control of.

## Official links and company profiles

Use the official website for current services and contact details. Use the social profiles for company updates, and the review platforms to read what clients have chosen to share. These links are cross-referenced with [Algility’s official directory](https://algility.us/) and its website.

